rl":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/pull/4792.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/pull/4792.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"# Objective\r\nFixes #4791. `ParallelExecutor` inserts a default `CompteTaskPool` if there isn't one stored as a resource, including when it runs on a different world. When spawning the render sub-app, the main world's `ComputeTaskPool` is not cloned and inserted into the render app's, which causes a second `ComputeTaskPool` with the default configuration to be spawned. This results in an excess number of threads being spawned.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nCopy the task pools from the main world to the subapps upon creating them.\r\n\r\n## Alternative\r\nAn alternative to this would be to make the task pools global, as seen in #2250 or bevyengine/rfcs#54.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/4792/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/4792/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":6704386388,"node_id":"REFE_lADODf6-U85J37enzwAAAAGPnNFU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/events/6704386388","actor":{"login":"bors[bot]","id":26634292,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90MjY2MzQyOTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/bors","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bors%5Bbot%5D/or